mber">05</p><div data-wf-target="[[[&quot;6ac54b6e7658570aaa3bd29e&quot;,&quot;09f431b4-821d-6152-b052-530f131ba006&quot;],[]]]" class="about-panel-vertical"><p class="about-panel-vertical-text">Chobe River Safari</p></div><div data-wf-target="[[[&quot;6ac54b6e7658570aaa3bd29e&quot;,&quot;da53559a-3fa3-d40d-054b-17179acb5e79&quot;],[]]]" class="about-panel-info info-off"><h3 class="about-panel-title">Chobe River Safari</h3><p class="about-panel-text">Cruise the Chobe River and watch elephants and other wildlife gather along its banks.</p><a data-wf--primary-button--variant="base" data-wf-component-id="b1f5f4f7-681d-fd69-fc1c-e7dcb33d6009" data-wf-variant-state="base" href="destination.html" class="primary-button w-inline-block"><div class="button-item-main"><div class="button-text-pill"><div class="primay-button-text _01">Explore this trip</div><div class="primay-button-text _02">Explore this trip</div></div><div class="button-arrow-pill"><div class="arrow-wrapper"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" viewBox="0 0 21 21" fill="none" class="button-arrow"><path d="M3.5 9.625V11.375H14V13.125H15.75V11.375H17.5V9.625H15.75V7.875H14V9.625H3.5ZM12.25 6.125H14V7.875H12.25V6.125ZM12.25 6.125H10.5V4.375H12.25V6.125ZM12.25 14.875H14V13.125H12.25V14.875ZM12.25 14.875H10.5V16.625H12.25V14.875Z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" viewBox="0 0 21 21" fill="none" class="button-arrow"><path d="M3.5 9.625V11.375H14V13.125H15.75V11.375H17.5V9.625H15.75V7.875H14V9.625H3.5ZM12.25 6.125H14V7.875H12.25V6.125ZM12.25 6.125H10.5V4.375H12.25V6.125ZM12.25 14.875H14V13.125H12.25V14.875ZM12.25 14.875H10.5V16.625H12.25V14.875Z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></div></div><div class="button-animated-color"></div></div></a></div></div></div><div data-wf-target="[[[&quot;6ac54b6e7658570aaa3bd29e&quot;,&quot;bee80d18-59c3-2ca2-9aa5-6b299cb5743f&quot;],[]]]" class="about-panel hide-mobile"><img src="https://irp.cdn-website.com/e6c865a4/dms3rep/multi/opt/3cbe1f10-ad72-485c-974f-6391e563be6b-1920w.jpg" loading="lazy" alt="The Chobe River landscape in Botswana" class="about-panel-image"/><div data-wf-target="[[[&quot;6ac54b6e7658570aaa3bd29e&quot;,&quot;5ddd0656-0b8a-e500-64c1-4e0379ba8bd0&quot;],[]]]" class="about-panel-overlay"></div><div data-wf-target="[[[&quot;6ac54b6e7658570aaa3bd29e&quot;,&quot;5c556a0a-ae8e-22a3-5d6b-66a7916fb0df&quot;],[]]]" class="about-panel-content"><p data-wf-target="[[[&quot;6ac54b6e7658570aaa3bd29e&quot;,&quot;0480555f-6a4b-b099-febe-c28166e3f04c&quot;],[]]]" class="about-panel-number">06</p><div data-wf-target="[[[&quot;6ac54b6e7658570aaa3bd29e&quot;,&quot;f34dc778-c8e5-fd00-c6c1-e26f81d31925&quot;],[]]]" class="about-panel-vertical"><p class="about-panel-vertical-text">Safari Experience</p></div><div data-wf-target="[[[&quot;6ac54b6e7658570aaa3bd29e&quot;,&quot;121bf361-83f3-7813-bc73-9e0914a2146a&quot;],[]]]" class="about-panel-info info-off"><h3 class="about-panel-title">Safari Experience</h3><p class="about-panel-text">Early game drives, trusted rangers and nights under wide open skies.</p><a data-wf--primary-button--variant="base" data-wf-component-id="b1f5f4f7-681d-fd69-fc1c-e7dcb33d6009" data-wf-variant-state="base" href="destination.html" class="primary-button w-inline-block"><div class="button-item-main"><div class="button-text-pill"><div class="primay-button-text _01">Explore this trip</div><div class="primay-button-text _02">Explore this trip</div></div><div class="button-arrow-pill"><div class="arrow-wrapper"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" viewBox="0 0 21 21" fill="none" class="button-arrow"><path d="M3.5 9.625V11.375H14V13.125H15.75V11.375H17.5V9.625H15.75V7.875H14V9.625H3.5ZM12.25 6.125H14V7.875H12.25V6.125ZM12.25 6.125H10.5V4.375H12.25V6.125ZM12.25 14.875H14V13.125H12.25V14.875ZM12.25 14.875H10.5V16.625H12.25V14.875Z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" viewBox="0 0 21 21" fill="none" class="button-arrow"><path d="M3.5 9.625V11.375H14V13.125H15.75V11.375H17.5V9.625H15.75V7.875H14V9.625H3.5ZM12.25 6.125H14V7.875H12.25V6.125ZM12.25 6.125H10.5V4.375H12.25V6.125ZM12.25 14.875H14V13.125H12.25V14.875ZM12.25 14.875H10.5V16.625H12.25V14.875Z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></div></div><div class="button-animated-color"></div></div></a></div></div></div></div><div class="space-4-medium"></div></div></section><section class="section black"><div class="about-marquee"><p class="about-marquee-text">Islands ✦ Mountains ✦ Coasts ✦ Cities ✦ Safari ✦ Islands ✦ Mountains</p></div><div class="space-4-medium"></div><div class="w-layout-blockcontainer container w-container"><div class="about-split-header stats"><div class="about-split-title journey"><div class="badge-wrap"><div data-wf--section-badge--variant="base" class="section-badge"><div class="badge-text">Your Journey Route</div></div></div><h2 class="section-heading">How your journey unfolds, one stop at a time.</h2></div><div class="about-route-counter-wrap"><div class="about-route-counter"><p class="about-route-counter">03 / 05</p></div><p class="about-route-counter-text">Scroll to travel along the route. Each stop lights up as you reach it.</p></div></div><div class="about-route-grid"><div class="about-stop"><div class="about-stop-slot top"></div><div class="about-marker-row"><div class="about-route-line hidden"></div><p class="about-marker">01</p><div class="about-route-line"></div></div><div class="about-stop-slot"><div class="about-route-connector"></div><div class="about-stop-card"><div class="about-stop-image-wrap"><img src="https://irp.cdn-website.com/e6c865a4/dms3rep/multi/opt/ae9159c2-b88c-4cce-842d-56d53baf764d-2880w.jpg" loading="lazy" alt="A wide southern African landscape at sunset" class="about-cover-image"/></div><div class="about-stop-text-wrap"><div class="about-stop-eyebrow"><p class="about-stop-eyebrow">Stop 01 · Dream</p></div><h3 class="about-stop-title">Share your idea</h3><p class="about-stop-text">Tell us the places, moods and moments you imagine. No fixed plan needed.</p></div></div></div></div><div class="about-stop"><div class="about-stop-slot top"><div class="about-stop-card"><div class="about-stop-image-wrap"><img src="https://irp.cdn-website.com/e6c865a4/dms3rep/multi/opt/Vic_Falls_Feb_2016_Sarah_Kerr-1421-e1650922121587-1920w.jpg" loading="lazy" alt="The spray of Victoria Falls rising above the rainforest" class="about-cover-image"/></div><div class="about-stop-text-wrap"><p class="about-stop-eyebrow">Stop 02 · Plan</p><h3 class="about-stop-title">Shape the route</h3><p class="about-stop-text">We map stays, transfers and experiences around your pace and budget.</p></div></div><div class="about-route-connector"></div></div><div class="about-marker-row"><div class="about-route-line"></div><p class="about-marker">02</p><div class="about-route-line"></div></div><div class="about-stop-slot"></div></div><div class="about-stop"><div class="about-stop-slot top"></div><div class="about-marker-row"><div class="about-route-line"></div><p class="about-marker active">03</p><div class="about-route-line"></div></div><div class="about-stop-slot"><div class="about-route-connector"></div><div class="about-stop-card active"><div class="about-stop-image-wrap"><img src="https://irp.cdn-website.com/e6c865a4/dms3rep/multi/opt/3cbe1f10-ad72-485c-974f-6391e563be6b-1920w.jpg" loading="lazy" alt="The Chobe River landscape in Botswana" class="about-cover-image"/></div><div class="about-stop-text-wrap"><p class="about-stop-eyebrow light">Stop 03 · Depart</p><h3 class="about-stop-title light">Travel with ease</h3><p class="about-stop-text light">Everything is booked and timed, so departure day feels calm and simple.</p></div></div></div></div><div class="about-stop"><div class="about-stop-slot top"><div class="about-stop-card"><div class="about-stop-image-wrap"><img src="https://irp.cdn-website.com/e6c865a4/dms3rep/multi/opt/IMG_1449-1920w.JPG" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 767px) 100vw, (max-width: 938px) 95vw, 892px" alt="A safari camp beneath a wide African sky" class="about-cover-image"/></div><div class="about-stop-text-wrap"><p class="about-stop-eyebrow">Stop 04 · Explore</p><h3 class="about-stop-title">Live the journey</h3><p class="about-stop-text">Local guides and on-ground support keep every day flowing smoothly.</p></div></div><div class="about-route-connector"></div></div><div class="about-marker-row"><div class="about-route-line"></div><p class="about-marker upcoming">04</p><div class="about-route-line"></div></div><div class="about-stop-slot"></div></div><div class="about-stop"><div class="about-stop-slot top"></div><div class="about-marker-row"><div class="about-route-line"></div><p class="about-marker upcoming">05</p><div class="about-route-line hidden"></div></div><div class="about-stop-slot"><div class="about-route-connector"></div><div class="about-stop-card"><div class="about-stop-image-wrap"><img src="https://irp.cdn-website.com/e6c865a4/dms3rep/multi/opt/IMG_3957-1920w.JPG" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 767px) 100vw, (max-width: 938px) 95vw, 892px" alt="Elephants gathered at a waterhole in Hwange National Park" class="about-cover-image"/></div><div class="about-stop-text-wrap"><p class="about-stop-eyebrow">Stop 05 · Remember</p><h3 class="about-stop-title">Bring it home</h3><p class="about-stop-text">Photos, stories and a follow-up so the trip lasts long after landing.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="space-8-small"></div></section><section class="section blue"><div class="space-8-small"></div><div class="w-layout-blockcontainer container w-container"><div class="about-why-grid"><div class="why-avenora-left"><div class="why-avenora-header"><div class="badge-wrap"><div data-wf--section-badge--variant="bg" class="section-badge w-variant-cbbf38fe-d1d9-25df-a3f8-ed2322a2901f"><div class="badge-text w-variant-cbbf38fe-d1d9-25df-a3f8-ed2322a2901f">Why Cuckoo Safaris</div></div></div><div class="why-heading-wrap"><h2 class="section-heading night">Why travellers choose Cuckoo Safaris</h2><p class="about-text">Every Cuckoo Safaris trip is shaped by the same four promises.</p></div><div class="button-wrap"><a data-wf--primary-button--variant="base" data-wf-component-id="b1f5f4f7-681d-fd69-fc1c-e7dcb33d6009" data-wf-variant-state="base" href="package.html" class="primary-button w-inline-block"><div class="button-item-main"><div class="button-text-pill"><div class="primay-button-text _01">View Safaris</div><div class="primay-button-text _02">View Safaris</div></div><div class="button-arrow-pill"><div class="arrow-wrapper"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" viewBox="0 0 21 21" fill="none" class="button-arrow"><path d="M3.5 9.625V11.375H14V13.125H15.75V11.375H17.5V9.625H15.75V7.875H14V9.625H3.5ZM12.25 6.125H14V7.875H12.25V6.125ZM12.25 6.125H10.5V4.375H12.25V6.125ZM12.25 14.875H14V13.125H12.25V14.875ZM12.25 14.875H10.5V16.625H12.25V14.875Z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" viewBox="0 0 21 21" fill="none" class="button-arrow"><path d="M3.5 9.625V11.375H14V13.125H15.75V11.375H17.5V9.625H15.75V7.875H14V9.625H3.5ZM12.25 6.125H14V7.875H12.25V6.125ZM12.25 6.125H10.5V4.375H12.25V6.125ZM12.25 14.875H14V13.125H12.25V14.875ZM12.25 14.875H10.5V16.625H12.25V14.875Z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></div></div><div class="button-animated-color"></div></div></a></div></div></div><div class="about-why-cards"><div class="about-why-card"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6a13e532999601af0ed6354d/6a21baea4b6381e32b13a34c_image%20164.png" loading="lazy" alt="Blue icon of a person writing with a pen on paper at a desk" class="about-why-icon"/><div class="about-why-card-text-wrap"><h3 class="about-why-card-title">Personal, not packaged</h3><p class="about-why-card-text">Explore Victoria Falls, Hwange, Chobe and other Southern African highlights with local insight and flexible itineraries.</p></div></div><div class="about-why-card"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6a13e532999601af0ed6354d/6a21baeab5a8d5e4f670374d_image%20164.png" loading="lazy" alt="Blue suitcase icon with a paper airplane and swoosh lines" class="about-why-icon"/><div class="about-why-card-text-wrap"><h3 class="about-why-card-title">Beautifully planned details</h3><p class="about-why-card-text">From hotels to transfers, experiences and timing, every detail is considered.</p></div></div><div class="about-why-card"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6a13e532999601af0ed6354d/6a21bc3b3e083b80cee1266c_image%20164%20(1).png" loading="lazy" alt="Blue water droplet icon with waves and an upward arrow" class="about-why-icon"/><div class="about-why-card-text-wrap"><h3 class="about-why-card-title">Handpicked stays</h3><p class="about-why-card-text">We focus on places and moments that feel refined, memorable, and worth the journey.</p></div></div><div class="about-why-card"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6a13e532999601af0ed6354d/6a21bc3b378c84089e4810d6_image%20164%20(1).png" loading="lazy" alt="Blue icon of a hand holding a group of people" class="about-why-icon"/><div class="about-why-card-text-wrap"><h3 class="about-why-card-title">Local expertise</h3><p class="about-why-card-text">Trusted guides and partners on the ground, with real support whenever you need it.</p></div></div></div></div></div><div class="space-8-small"></div></section><section class="section"><div class="space-8-small"></div><div class="w-layout-blockcontainer container w-container"><div class="about-section-header center"><div class="badge-wrap"><div data-wf--section-badge--variant="base" class="section-badge"><div class="badge-text">Our Journeys</div></div></div><div class="journey-header"><h2 class="section-heading night center">Journeys we love to design</h2><p class="about-text">A few of the places and moments our travellers remember most.</p></div></div><div class="about-journeys-grid"><div class="about-journey-card"><img src="https://irp.cdn-website.com/e6c865a4/dms3rep/multi/opt/Victoria-Falls-1+%281%29-1920w.jpeg" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 767px) 100vw, (max-width: 938px) 95vw, 892px" alt="Victoria Falls seen from the Zimbabwean rainforest" class="about-journey-image"/><div class="about-journey-label-wrap"><div data-wf--section-badge--variant="bg" class="section-badge w-variant-cbbf38fe-d1d9-25df-a3f8-ed2322a2901f"><div class="badge-text w-variant-cbbf38fe-d1d9-25df-a3f8-ed2322a2901f">Victoria Falls</div></div></div></div><div class="about-journey-card tall"><img src="https://irp.cdn-website.com/e6c865a4/dms3rep/multi/opt/IMG_3957-1920w.JPG" loading="lazy" sizes="100vw" alt="Elephants beside a waterhole in Hwange National Park" class="about-journey-image"/><div class="about-journey-label-wrap"><div data-wf--section-badge--variant="bg" class="section-badge w-variant-cbbf38fe-d1d9-25df-a3f8-ed2322a2901f"><div class="badge-text w-variant-cbbf38fe-d1d9-25df-a3f8-ed2322a2901f">Hwange wildlife</div></div></div></div><div class="about-journey-card hide-tab"><img src="https://irp.cdn-website.com/e6c865a4/dms3rep/multi/opt/3cbe1f10-ad72-485c-974f-6391e563be6b-1920w.jpg" loading="lazy" sizes="100vw" alt="The Chobe River landscape in Botswana" class="about-journey-image"/><div class="about-journey-label-wrap"><div data-wf--section-badge--variant="bg" class="section-badge w-variant-cbbf38fe-d1d9-25df-a3f8-ed2322a2901f"><div class="badge-text w-variant-cbbf38fe-d1d9-25df-a3f8-ed2322a2901f">Chobe River</div></div></div></div><div class="about-journey-card tall hide-tablet"><img src="https://irp.cdn-website.com/e6c865a4/dms3rep/multi/opt/IMG_1449-1920w.JPG" loading="lazy" sizes="100vw" alt="A safari camp beneath a wide African sky" class="about-journey-image"/><div class="about-journey-label-wrap"><div data-wf--section-badge--variant="bg" class="section-badge w-variant-cbbf38fe-d1d9-25df-a3f8-ed2322a2901f"><div class="badge-text w-variant-cbbf38fe-d1d9-25df-a3f8-ed2322a2901f">Safari camps</div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="space-5-small"></div></section><section data-wf-component-id="48adce3f-8d40-d8bf-fea6-d884c40d34dd" data-wf-variant-state="base" class="section cta"><div class="w-layout-blockcontainer container w-container"><div class="cta-wrapper"><div class="cta-title-wrapper"><div class="max-width-38"><h2 class="section-heading">Moments that make the journey feel personal.</h2></div><div class="max-width-33"><p class="font-1-extra-small white">Cuckoo Safaris is a Victoria Falls-based tour operator offering guided safaris and day tours across Southern Africa.</p></div></div><div class="button-wrap"><a data-wf--primary-button--variant="base" data-wf-component-id="b1f5f4f7-681d-fd69-fc1c-e7dcb33d6009" data-wf-variant-state="base" href="https://maps.app.goo.gl/SHMNXq7QDubJm4L87" target="_blank" class="primary-button w-inline-block"><div class="button-item-main"><div class="button-text-pill"><div class="primay-button-text _01">See All Maps</div><div class="primay-button-text _02">See All Maps</div></div><div class="button-arrow-pill"><div class="arrow-wrapper"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" viewBox="0 0 21 21" fill="none" class="button-arrow"><path d="M3.5 9.625V11.375H14V13.125H15.75V11.375H17.5V9.625H15.75V7.875H14V9.625H3.5ZM12.25 6.125H14V7.875H12.25V6.125ZM12.25 6.125H10.5V4.375H12.25V6.125ZM12.25 14.875H14V13.125H12.25V14.875ZM12.25 14.875H10.5V16.625H12.25V14.875Z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" viewBox="0 0 21 21" fill="none" class="button-arrow"><path d="M3.5 9.625V11.375H14V13.125H15.75V11.375H17.5V9.625H15.75V7.875H14V9.625H3.5ZM12.25 6.125H14V7.875H12.25V6.125ZM12.25 6.125H10.5V4.375H12.25V6.125ZM12.25 14.875H14V13.125H12.25V14.875ZM12.25 14.875H10.5V16.625H12.25V14.875Z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></div></div><div class="button-animated-color"></div></div></a></div></div></div></section></div><secti